       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TOTIENT-BOLTZMANN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOTIENT-BOLTZMANN-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EULER-TOTIENT-FIELD-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GIBBS-TOTIENT-ENTROPY-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PARTITION-COPRIME-SUM-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT0-GROUND-STATE-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-THERMAL-EQUILIBRIUM-DET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TOTIENT-BOLTZMANN-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-BOLTZMANN-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-BOLTZMANN-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-COPRIME-STATES.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ENTROPY-AND-PARTITION.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-GROUND-STATE.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-BOLTZMANN-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-COPRIME-STATES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EULER-TOTIENT-FIELD-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PARTITION-COPRIME-SUM-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ENTROPY-AND-PARTITION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GIBBS-TOTIENT-ENTROPY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-THERMAL-EQUILIBRIUM-DET.
       3000-EVALUATE-GROUND-STATE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT0-GROUND-STATE-OK.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-BOLTZMANN-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EULER-TOTIENT-FIELD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GIBBS-TOTIENT-ENTROPY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PARTITION-COPRIME-SUM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT0-GROUND-STATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-THERMAL-EQUILIBRIUM-DET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-BOLTZMANN-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-BOLTZMANN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-BOLTZMANN-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-BOLTZMANN-CODE.
